primary p_lambda:   d/dt p_lambda = 1/2*R^2 - 1/2*x1^2 - 1/2*x2^2 - 1/2*x3^2
chi1 = |x|^2 - R^2: d/dt chi1 = 2*(p1*x1 + p2*x2 + p3*x3)/m
chi2 = x.p:         d/dt chi2 = -lam*x1^2 - lam*x2^2 - lam*x3^2 + p1^2/m + p2^2/m + p3^2/m
chi3 = |p|^2/m - lambda |x|^2: d/dt chi3 = -u*x1^2 - u*x2^2 - u*x3^2 - 4*lam*p1*x1/m - 4*lam*p2*x2/m - 4*lam*p3*x3/m
d/dt chi3 + u |x|^2 + (4 lambda/m) x.p = 0  -> on the surface u = 0: the chain stops
lambda from chi3 = 0: lam == (p1^2 + p2^2 + p3^2)/(m*x1^2 + m*x2^2 + m*x3^2)
